{
  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for PetMemoryVault', 'description': 'Primary container for PetMemoryVault implementation: MyPetStory is a personalized online journal for pet owners to capture, organize, and share every special moment of their pet’s life. It allows users to add photos, milestones, and memories, create a printable scrapbook, and share a timeline of their pet’s journey with loved ones. The platform is designed to be a digital keepsake, making it easy to celebrate and preserve every memory.', 'interfaces': [], 'framework': 'react', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "PetMemoryVault-35426 frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "Add Memory",\n      "description": "Users can add new memories, including photos and descriptions, to their pet\\u2019s journal. Each memory can be tagged with a date and categorized (e.g., first walk, birthday, vet visit).",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Timeline",\n      "description": "A chronological, visually appealing timeline displays all added memories, milestones, and photos, allowing users to easily browse their pet\\u2019s life story.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Photos",\n      "description": "Upload and organize photos for each memory or milestone. Photos can be added directly when creating a new memory or milestone entry.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Milestones",\n      "description": "Mark and describe important milestones in the pet\\u2019s life (e.g., first bath, first birthday, adoption day). Milestones are highlighted in the timeline and scrapbook.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Printable Scrapbook",\n      "description": "Automatically generate a printable scrapbook that compiles all memories, photos, and milestones, including user-added descriptions. The scrapbook updates in real-time as new content is added.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Shareable Story Timeline",\n      "description": "Easily share the pet\\u2019s story timeline with family and friends via a private or public link, allowing others to view the journey online.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#FFB347",\n    "secondary": "#FFF8E1",\n    "accent": "#6EC6CA"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "The homepage features a welcoming dashboard with a pet profile section at the top. Below, users see a timeline view with cards for each memory, milestone, or photo. An \'Add Memory\' button opens a modal to input descriptions and upload photos. The sidebar provides quick access to the scrapbook (with live updates), milestones, and sharing options. The scrapbook page displays a printable, styled compilation of all memories, photos, and milestones, with editable descriptions. Sharing options are accessible from both the timeline and scrapbook views."\n}'}",
